---
/* Astro migration entrypoint. The current static HTML remains the compatibility entry
   until Astro build output and Vercel Function routing are verified together. */
import "../styles/tailwind.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="id" data-theme="dark" data-motion="basic">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#080b13" />
    <meta name="description" content="HyperAI — a lightweight OpenRouter chat client by HyperGaruda." />
    <title>HyperAI · Astro migration shell</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>HyperAI Astro migration shell</h1>
      <p>This route is an integration checkpoint, not the production chat entry. The live compatibility entry remains <a href="/index.html">the current HyperAI client</a> until Astro, Tailwind and Vercel Functions pass build and route regression tests.</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
